+# Password Hashing
+
+The project's current recorded decision is to hash passwords with Argon2id. It was chosen for its memory-hard design, which gives stronger resistance to GPU-accelerated brute-force attacks and sets a higher security bar for authentication credentials. No specific parameter values (memory, iterations, parallelism) are recorded.
